 Winds","r":[0.0815,0.5078,0.0537,0.043],"k":"a"},{"n":"Viridescent Venerer","r":[0.5065,0.5078,0.0537,0.043],"k":"a"},{"n":"Noblesse Oblige","r":[0.0815,0.5678,0.0537,0.043],"k":"a"},{"n":"Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","r":[0.0815,0.6707,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Hurricane Seed","r":[0.5065,0.6707,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Philosophies of Ballad","r":[0.0815,0.7248,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Slime Concentrate","r":[0.5065,0.7248,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Cecilia","r":[0.0815,0.7789,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Tail of Boreas","r":[0.5065,0.7789,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Crown of Insight","r":[0.0815,0.833,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"}]},{"img":"content/genshin/builds/venti/261111-225334/zh-3.webp","t":"content/genshin/builds/venti/261111-225334/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"The Daybreak Chronicles","r":[0.1093,0.2541,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"w"},{"n":"Elegy for the End","r":[0.1093,0.3274,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"w"},{"n":"Polar Star","r":[0.1093,0.4007,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"w"},{"n":"A Day Carved From Rising Winds","r":[0.5231,0.2541,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"a"},{"n":"Viridescent Venerer","r":[0.5231,0.3274,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"a"},{"n":"Noblesse Oblige","r":[0.5231,0.3937,0.0454,0.0363],"k":"a"},{"n":"Venti","r":[0.0815,0.5163,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Durin","r":[0.125,0.5163,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Faruzan","r":[0.1685,0.5163,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.212,0.5163,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Venti","r":[0.0815,0.5756,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.125,0.5756,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1685,0.5756,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Jean","r":[0.212,0.5756,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Venti","r":[0.0815,0.6281,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Ganyu","r":[0.125,0.6281,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Mona","r":[0.1685,0.6281,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Diona","r":[0.212,0.6281,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Venti","r":[0.0815,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Yumemizuki Mizuki","r":[0.125,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Furina","r":[0.1685,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]},{"n":"Ororon","r":[0.212,0.6807,0.0361,0.0289]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/venti/261111-225334/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"The Daybreak Chronicles","text":"HEX-focused signature bow that enhances Venti’s on-field Windsunder Arrow damage; strongest fit for his HEX DPS playstyle. HEX Main DPS with Witch’s Homework completed."},{"name":"Polar Star","text":"CRIT Rate and stacking ATK from varied hits boost direct Anemo damage in a HEX DPS build. Requires stack management for best value."},{"name":"Skyward Harp","text":"CR and CD strengthen direct Anemo DMG."},{"name":"Elegy for the End","text":"Energy Recharge and a teamwide ATK/EM buff after its effect triggers make it excellent for off-field support. Support / Sub DPS, especially reaction teams."},{"name":"The Stringless","text":"Elemental Mastery strengthens Swirl while the passive increases Skill and Burst damage; excellent off-field option. Swirl support or off-field damage."},{"name":"Favonius Warbow","text":"Energy Recharge plus neutral particles from CRIT hits help Venti and energy-hungry teammates Burst reliably. Support; needs some CRIT Rate to trigger."},{"name":"Song of Stillness","text":"Craftable ATK bow with a damage bonus after healing, offering a lower-spend route for HEX DPS. Best with a healer to activate its passive."},{"name":"Windblume Ode","text":"Elemental Mastery boosts Swirl; Skill use grants a short ATK buff for a flexible older event alternative. Only if obtained during its event."}],"a":[{"names":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Best for Venti’s HEX on-field DPS: sustained on-field attacks benefit from its ATK and CRIT bonuses.","stats":"ATK% · Anemo DMG · CRIT"},{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Boosts Swirl and reduces enemy RES to the Swirled element by 40%, greatly improving elemental team damage.","stats":"EM · EM · EM (or ATK/Anemo/CRIT)"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst grants the party 20% ATK for 12s.","stats":"ER/ATK% · Anemo/ATK% · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Winds of the Witch","members":["Venti","Durin","Faruzan","Bennett"],"text":"Durin enables HEX and adds off-field damage; Faruzan boosts Anemo damage while Bennett supplies ATK, healing and a Swirlable Pyro aura.","roles":["Crowd Control / Debuffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Anemo Buffer / Debuffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Thunderous Encore","members":["Venti","Fischl","Furina","Jean"],"text":"Fischl activates HEX, Furina adds damage and buffs, and Jean heals. Venti drives Electro-Charged Swirls with infused attacks.","roles":["Crowd Control / Debuffer","Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Permafrost","members":["Venti","Ganyu","Mona","Diona"],"text":"Ganyu and Mona freeze grouped enemies while Diona protects and heals. Venti gathers targets and shreds Cryo RES.","roles":["Crowd Control / Debuffer","On-field DPS","t","Shielder / Healer"]},{"name":"Swirl and Chill","members":["Venti","Yumemizuki Mizuki","Furina","Ororon"],"text":"Mizuki drives Swirls; Furina and Ororon supply off-field damage. Venti groups enemies and supports Electro-Charged reactions.","roles":["Crowd Control / Debuffer","On-field Driver","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]}],"v":"HEX Main DPS: A Day Carved From Rising Winds; ATK/Anemo/CRIT. Complete Witch’s Homework and bring another Hexerei teammate.\nSwirl Support: Viridescent Venerer with EM/EM/EM and Elegy, Stringless or Favonius; prioritize Burst uptime.\nCRIT Sub DPS: Use ATK/Anemo/CRIT and Skyward Harp for personal Skill/Burst damage instead of pure Swirl scaling.\nNoblesse Team Buff: Use Noblesse when another Anemo already provides Viridescent shred; keep enough ER to Burst reliably.\nF2P HEX: Use craftable Song of Stillness with a healer and build ATK/Anemo/CRIT.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS / Support"],"about":"Venti can play on-field HEX Main DPS after completing Witch’s Homework alongside another Hexerei teammate, using Windsunder Arrows for Anemo damage. Alternatively, he groups enemies and supports off-field damage with Swirl, Viridescent Venerer RES shred, and Energy refunds.","pros":["Strong crowd control","HEX on-field option","Flexible support builds","Excellent Swirl utility"],"cons":["Needs HEX partner for DPS","Burst misses heavy enemies","Energy needs vary","Swirl cannot CRIT"],"weapons":["The Daybreak Chronicles","Polar Star","Skyward Harp","Elegy for the End","The Stringless","Favonius Warbow","Song of Stillness","Windblume Ode"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"HEX DPS"},{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Team Buff"}],"main":["ATK% (HEX) / Elemental Mastery (Support)","Anemo DMG (HEX) / Elemental Mastery (Support)","CRIT (HEX) / Elemental Mastery (Support)"],"stats":["HEX CRIT Rate: 60% - 75%","HEX CRIT DMG: 120% - 180%+","Support EM: 700 - 900+","Energy Recharge: 140% - 180% (team-dependent)"],"vars":[{"title":"HEX Main DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["The Daybreak Chronicles","Polar Star","Skyward Harp","Song of Stillness"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% sands, Anemo DMG goblet and CRIT circlet; prioritize CRIT, ATK and sufficient ER.","teams":"Witch’s Homework completed and a second Hexerei teammate.","when":"Use Venti as the on-field damage dealer with Windsunder Arrows and HEX buffs.","cond":"Requires Hexerei team activation.","notes":"This is the main on-field option within the same Studio guide, not a second build ID.","pre":false},{"title":"Swirl Support / Sub DPS","role":"Support / Off-field DPS","weapons":["Elegy for the End","The Stringless","Favonius Warbow","Windblume Ode"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prefer EM/EM/EM for Swirl and enough ER for Burst. CRIT Rate matters on Favonius.","teams":"Pyro, Hydro, Electro or Cryo teammates who benefit from grouping and RES shred.","when":"Swap to Venti for grouping, Swirl damage, elemental RES shred and team utility rather than extended on-field attacks.","cond":"Viridescent only shreds the element actually Swirled.","notes":"Noblesse is an option if another teammate already handles Viridescent.","pre":false},{"title":"CRIT Off-field DPS","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Skyward Harp","The Daybreak Chronicles","The Stringless"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Anemo DMG / CRIT with enough ER for Burst.","teams":"Teams where direct Burst damage matters and reaction-focused EM is less valuable.","when":"For well-invested Venti builds that favor personal direct damage while still providing grouping.","cond":"Needs good CRIT and ATK investment.","notes":"Swirl damage itself cannot CRIT.","pre":false},{"title":"Accessible HEX DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Song of Stillness","Skyward Harp"],"arts":[{"sets":["A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Anemo DMG / CRIT; build enough ER for regular Bursts.","teams":"Another Hexerei character plus a healer for Song of Stillness.","when":"A low-spend approach to Venti’s HEX playstyle without his signature bow.","cond":"Complete Witch’s Homework and trigger weapon healing passive.","notes":"Song of Stillness is craftable; other options depend on owned inventory.","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Hurricane Seed","Teachings of Ballad","Guide to Ballad","Philosophies of Ballad","Slime Condensate","Slime Secretions","Slime Concentrate","Cecilia","Tail of Boreas","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6-8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Winds of the Witch","members":["Venti","Durin","Faruzan","Bennett"]},{"name":"Thunderous Encore","members":["Venti","Fischl","Furina","Jean"]},{"name":"Permafrost","members":["Venti","Ganyu","Mona","Diona"]},{"name":"Swirl and Chill","members":["Venti","Yumemizuki Mizuki","Furina","Ororon"]}]}}],"title":"Venti","el":"Anemo"}